  "description": "Webtoon work of \"The Prince of the Dragon\", a web novel of the same name! \"Loo\", who has just reached adulthood, squeezes his fathers into the magic school. Lou falls in love with \"Ian\", Prince of Peloders at first sight, and Ian is also somewhat attracted to Lou, but... Lu is actually a hidden child of a dragon who lost his life to the Emperor of Peloders long ago, and Ian They learn magic and try to hunt dragons... Can the two share their love while hiding their secrets?\n\n(Source: Korean publisher, translated)\nNote: Chapter count includes 21 side stories.",
